    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of hypocalcemia, radiologic bone changes consistent with rickets, and elevated alkaline phosphatase",
    "notes": "Diagnosis should exclude other causes of rickets such as hypophosphatemic rickets or genetic forms"
